(6771491, 1015647, 108991, '<td valign="top">The fun of kicking the fallen leaves as high as you can - very well expressed. The movement works to express the playful feeling. Composition seems a bit out of balance.</td>', 'The fun of kicking the fallen leaves as high as you can - very well expressed. The movement works to express the playful feeling. Composition seems a bit out of balance.', '2012-05-17 11:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
