(6771505, 1015738, 108991, '<td valign="top">Wow, which planet did you visit to see this..? I feel a strog tension between the colourful and highly detailed forground, and the pale blue, blurred background. My eye is attracter towards the latter, but there isn''t enough to see.</td>', 'Wow, which planet did you visit to see this..? I feel a strog tension between the colourful and highly detailed forground, and the pale blue, blurred background. My eye is attracter towards the latter, but there isn''t enough to see.', '2012-05-17 11:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
