(6772827, 1015675, 132996, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, clean photo. I would have to say a bit too much dodging and burning on the foreground (or at least HDR) to the point of distraction. However, overall, very solid composition.</td>', 'Beautiful, clean photo. I would have to say a bit too much dodging and burning on the foreground (or at least HDR) to the point of distraction. However, overall, very solid composition.', '2012-05-18 18:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6772830, 1014893, 132996, '<td valign="top">This setup had potential, but to me, it falls flat in its composition. I like how kittie blends into the leaves, but placing her right in the center and including the greenery at the top of the image ruins the image.</td>', 'This setup had potential, but to me, it falls flat in its composition. I like how kittie blends into the leaves, but placing her right in the center and including the greenery at the top of the image ruins the image.', '2012-05-18 18:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
